<title>NIGERIA: Total Nigeria 1996 profits lower.</title>
<headline>Total Nigeria 1996 profits lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for oil marketer</p>
<p>Total Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				     1996	1995</p>
<p> Turnover			 14,000 vs 15,600</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	1,000 vs 1,700</p>
<p> Taxation			  201.2 vs 646</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	 837.8 vs 1,100</p>
<p> Dividend     2.00 naira per share vs 5.00 per share</p>
<p>Proposed bonus share issue:one new share for six</p>
<p>Closure date: April 14 to 28, 1997.</p>
<p>Payment date: June 16, 1997.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
